        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "M. Nothing herein contained shall be construed to prohibit the Board from offering an extended contract to an individual teacher provided, however, that no teacher shall be required to accept an extension except as may be provided elsewhere in this Contract. Employees shall be reimbursed for any extensions at their daily rate of pay except as may be provided elsewhere in this Contract.",
