        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "O. The Board may require an extension of up to three (3) days, contiguous to pre-planning, for ten (10) month employees to conduct preliminary screening of students as required by the PREP law (Florida Statute). Teachers shall be reimbursed at their daily rate of pay for the upcoming school year. Teachers will be notified of the dates of said contract extension no later than the last day of post-planning.",
