        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "P. The Board may require up to two (2) days of district-wide orientation for teachers new to the district or returning after a break in service of five (5) or more years. The orientation session shall precede preschool planning by no more than one (1) week. Teachers required to attend shall receive a stipend of fifty dollars ($50) per day for attendance.",
